      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Asked for the name, Star Constellation Immortal Venerable calls it Transient White Cloud City Suppression. Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable created it but did not perfect it. After Heavenly Court explored human path deeply, they completed it. She forcefully uses a wisdom path method to stabilize the formation even when it should already have broken.",
      "chapters": [
        2192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among major methods on the wider battlefield, Transient White Cloud City Suppression is named again as a painting path formation.",
